      "writtenOn": "2024-02-12T20:41:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think practically it makes sense to have a single Recorder per DrawContext but I don\u0027t think we have that limitation right now. I\u0027m going to land this with an assert right now but will think about if there\u0027s a better way to approach all of this.",
      "parentUuid": "a61072bb_7fdc003a",
